  "code": "from cyhole.jupiter import Jupiter\nfrom cyhole.jupiter.client import GetSwapOrderParams, PostSwapExecuteBody\n\n# Token addresses on Solana mainnet\nUSDC = \"EPjFWaJY5iBwFAJz1qNVzKvPWGhLqXMvkD7jG5LeFVM\"\nWSOL = \"So11111111111111111111111111111111111111112\"\nAMOUNT = 1_000_000  # 1 SOL (in lamports)\n\n# Initialize Jupiter interaction\njupiter = Jupiter()\n\n# Step 1: Get swap quote (order)\nprint(\"Requesting swap quote for SOL to USDC...\")\nswap_order_params = GetSwapOrderParams(\n    input_mint=WSOL,\n    output_mint=USDC,\n    amount=AMOUNT,\n)\nquote_response = jupiter.client.get_swap_order(swap_order_params)\nprint(f\"Quote received: {quote_response}\")\n\n# Step 2: Execute the swap\nprint(\"\\nExecuting swap...\")\nswap_execute_body = PostSwapExecuteBody(\n    swap_response=quote_response,\n)\nexecute_response = jupiter.client.post_swap_execute(swap_execute_body)\nprint(f\"Swap executed: {execute_response}\")",
  "result_text": "```python\nfrom cyhole.jupiter import Jupiter\nfrom cyhole.jupiter.client import GetSwapOrderParams, PostSwapExecuteBody\n\n# Token addresses on Solana mainnet\nUSDC = \"EPjFWaJY5iBwFAJz1qNVzKvPWGhLqXMvkD7jG5LeFVM\"\nWSOL = \"So11111111111111111111111111111111111111112\"\nAMOUNT = 1_000_000  # 1 SOL (in lamports)\n\n# Initialize Jupiter interaction\njupiter = Jupiter()\n\n# Step 1: Get swap quote (order)\nprint(\"Requesting swap quote for SOL to USDC...\")\nswap_order_params = GetSwapOrderParams(\n    input_mint=WSOL,\n    output_mint=USDC,\n    amount=AMOUNT,\n)\nquote_response = jupiter.client.get_swap_order(swap_order_params)\nprint(f\"Quote received: {quote_response}\")\n\n# Step 2: Execute the swap\nprint(\"\\nExecuting swap...\")\nswap_execute_body = PostSwapExecuteBody(\n    swap_response=quote_response,\n)\nexecute_response = jupiter.client.post_swap_execute(swap_execute_body)\nprint(f\"Swap executed: {execute_response}\")\n```",
